level="file"><did><unittitle>Technical Advisory Committee Meeting</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/525620</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1988-11-14/1988-11-15" type="inclusive">November 14-15, 1988</unitdate><container label="Box" type="box">1</container></did></c02><c02 id="aspace_0030e227f59c019ff3171dc47c65a5c0" level="file"><did><unittitle>Technical Advisory Panel</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/525621</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1988-11/1988-11" type="inclusive">November 1988</unitdate><container label="Box" type="box">1</container></did></c02><c02 id="aspace_d875a39a4a48272b2f28eda71c8d89bc" level="file"><did><unittitle>UM EXPRES Project Review and Plans for Year 3</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/525622</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1988-11-30/1988-11-30" type="inclusive">November 30, 1988</unitdate><container label="Box" type="box">1</container></did></c02></c01><c01 id="aspace_b70581a81de3f83ab75d2ac1dc140769" level="series"><did><unittitle>Publicity and Presentations</unittitle><unitid type="aspace_uri">/repositories/2/archival_objects/525592</unitid><unitdate datechar="creation" normal="1987/1989" type="inclusive">1987-1989</unitdate></did><scopecontent><p>The Publicity and Presentations series (.5 linear ft.), covering 1987-1989, has been sorted chronologically. The series contains newsletters about the EXPRES software application. It contains presentations given at various conferences of the software application. There is electronic mail (printed out) correspondence in this series. The series also contains the draft of a chapter, "Supporting Collaboration with Advanced Multimedia Electronic Mail: The NSF EXPRES Project," that Gary Olson and Daniel Atkins co-wrote for a book titled <title render="italic">Intellectual Teamwork: Social and Technological Foundations of Cooperative Work</title>.</p><